gnee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":"resolved","sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Describe the feature you'd like to request\r\n\r\nWe have this type:\r\n\r\n```ts\r\nexport type Overwrite<TType, TWith> = Omit<TType, keyof TWith> & TWith;\r\n```\r\n\r\nTypescript has these defs for Omit:\r\n```\r\ntype Omit<T, K extends keyof any> = Pick<T, Exclude<keyof T, K>>;\r\n\r\ntype Pick<T, K extends keyof T> = {\r\n    [P in K]: T[P];\r\n};\r\n\r\ntype Exclude<T, U> = T extends U ? never : T;\r\n```\r\n\r\nEvery single mapped type has a fixed cost to the language server and compiler, each layer is essentially 1 full iteration through the type after all. This utility can be achieved with a single mapped type and no typescript utilities, improving performance by 2-3x\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n### Describe the solution you'd like to see\r\n\r\nDo this:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/Nick-Lucas/gapstack/blob/e33655ca3139c87264da2edcbdf3d42e62f1697f/packages/light-type/src/lib/mergeLightObjects.ts#L7\r\n\r\n### Describe alternate solutions\r\n\r\nHate sick performance gainz\r\n\r\n### Additional information\r\n\r\n_No response_\r\n\r\n### 👨‍👧‍👦 Contributing\r\n\r\n- [X] 🙋‍♂️ Yes, I'd be down to file a PR implementing this feature!","closed_by":{"login":"KATT","id":459267,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1OTI2Nw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/459267?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KATT","html_url":"https://github.com/KATT","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KATT/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KATT/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KATT/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KATT/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KATT/s